          ],
          "content_ref": "artifact://riemann-corpus-v2/depth/units/openalex_w2164522729_v2_u03.txt",
          "source_title": "Vacuum stability, string density of states and the Riemann zeta function",
          "source_year": 2011,
          "source_type": "article",
          "viewpoint_tags": [
            "zero-density",
